hadiths[88]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2626","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''umraa jaaiz hai.'' aur Ata ne kaha ke mujh se Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se isi tarah bayan kya."
"2627","Madiney par (dushman ke hamley ka ( khof tha. isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) se aik ghoda jiska naam mandoob tha mus'taar liya, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is par Sawar huey (sahaaba bhi sath they) phir jab wapas huey to farmaya, hamein to koi khatre ki cheez nazar na aaii, albatta ye ghoda samandar ki tarah (tez daudtaa) paya."
"2628","main Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to aap Qitr ( Yaman ka aik dabeez khurdaraa kapda ( ki qamees qeemtii panch dirham ki pahney huey thin. aap ne (mujh se) farmaya, zara nazar utha kar meri us londi ko to dekh. usey ghar mein bhi ye kapdey pahnney se inkar hai. halanke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein mere paas usi ki aik qamees thi. jab koi ladki dulhan banai jati to mere yahan aadmi bhej kar wo qamees aariyatan mangaa leti thi."
"2629","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, kya hi umda hai hadiya us doodh dene wali ontni ka jisne abhi haal hi mein bachcha janaa ho aur doodh dene wali bakri ka jo subah w Sham apne doodh se bartan bhar deti hai. ham se Abdullaah-bin-Yoosuf aur Ismail ne bayan kya, unse Imam Malik ne bayan kya ke (doodh dene wali ontni ka ( sadqa kya hi umda hai."
"2630","jab muhajireen Makka se Madina aaey to unke sath koi bhi saman na tha. Ansar zameen aur jaaidaad waley they. Ansar ne muhajireen se ye mamla kar liya ke wo apne baghaat mein se unhein har saal phal diya karengey aur uske badley muhajireen unke baghaat mein kaam kya karein. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki walida Umme-Sulaim jo Abdullaah-bin-abii-Tal'ha (Raziallahu anhu) ki bhi walida thin, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khajoor ka aik baagh hadiya de diya tha lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo baagh apni londi umme-Aiman (Raziallahu anhu) jo Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ki walida thin, inayat farma diya. ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya ke mujhey Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab khaibar ke yahudiyon ki jang se farigh huey aur Madina tashrif laey to muhajireen ne Ansar ko unke tohfey wapas kar diye jo unhon-ne phalon ki sura mein de rakhey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki walida ka baagh bhi wapas kar diya aur umme-Aiman (Raziallahu anhu) ko iske bajaey apne baagh mein se (kuchh darakht) inayat farma diye. Ahmed bin shabeeb ne bayan kya, unhein unke walid ne khabar di aur unhein Yunus ne isi tarah albatta apni riwayat mein bajaaey (مكانهن من حائطه) ke (مكانهن من خالصه‏) bayaan kya."
"2631","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, chalis (40) khaslatein jin mein sabse aalaa w buland. doodh dene wali bakri ka hadiya karna hai. aisi hain ke jo shakhs unmein se aik khaslat par bhi aamil hoga sawab ki niyat se aur Allah ke waadey ko sachcha samajhtey huey to Allah Taala uski wjah se usey jannat mein dakhil karega. Hassan ne kaha ke doodh dene wali bakri ke hadiye ko chhod kar ham ne salam ka jawab denaa, chheenkney waley ka jawab dena aur takleef dene wali cheez ko rastey se hata dene wghaira ka shumaar kya, to sab pandarah khaslatein bhi ham shumaar na kar sakey."
"2632","ham mein se bahut se ashaab ke paas faaltu zameen bhi thi, unhon-ne kaha tha ke tehai ya chothai ya nisf ki batai par ham kyon na usey de diya karein. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jiske paas zameen ho to usey khud bonii chahiye ya phir kisi apne bhai ko hadiya kar deni chahiye aur agar aisa nahi karta to phir zameen apne paas rakhey rahe.''"
"2633","aik dehati Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hijrat ke liye poochha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya'' Allah tum par raham kare. hijrat ka to bada hi dushwar mamla hai. tumharey paas oont bhi hai?'' unhon-ne kaha ji haan! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya'' aur iska sadqa (zakaat) bhi ada kartey ho?'' unhon-ne kaha ji haan! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ''usmein se kuchh hadiya bhi detey ho? ''unhon-ne kaha ji haan! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya'' to tum usey pani pilaaney ke liye ghaat par ley janey waley din dohtey hogey?'' unhon-ne kaha ji haan! phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''samandaron ke paar bhi agar tum amal karogey to Allah Taala tumharey amal mein se koi cheez kam nahi karega.''"
"2634","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik martaba aisey khet ki taraf tashrif le gaey jiski kheti lahlaha rahi thi, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ''ye kis ka hai?'' sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne batlaya ke falan ne usey kiraaye par liya hai. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar wo hadiyatan de deta to us se behtar tha ke is par aik muqarrara ujrat wsool kartaa.''"
"2635","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Ibraaheem (Alaihissalam) ne Saara (Alaihissalam) ke sath hijrat ki to unhein badshah ne Aajar ko (yani Hajra (Alaihissalam) ko) Atiya mein de diya. phir wo wapas huin aur Ibrahim se kaha, dekha aap ne Allah Taala ne kaafir ko kis tarah zaleel kya aur aik ladki khidmat ke liye bhi de di. Ibne-Sirin ne kaha, unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan kya ke badshah ne Hajra ko unki khidmat ke liye de diya tha."
"2636","maine apne bap se suna wo bayan kartey they ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha maine aik ghoda Allah ke rastey mein jihad ke liye aik shakhs ko de diya tha, phir maine dekha ke wo usey bech raha hai. isliye maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ke usey waapasi mein hi khareed loon? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''is ghodey ko na khareed. apna diya hua sadqa wapas na lo.''"
"2637","jab un par tohmat lagaaney walon ne tohmat lagai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ali aur Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ko apni biwi (Aaisha (Raziallahu anhu)) ko apne se juda karne ke mutaalliq mashwara karne ke liye bulaayaa, kyonke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par ab tak (is silsiley mein) wahi nahi aai thi. Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ne to ye kaha ke aap ki paak bevi ( Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ( mein ham siwaey khair ke aur kuchh nahi jantey aur Barira (Raziallahu anhu) (unki khaadima ( ne kaha ke main koi aisi cheez nahi janti jis se un par aib lagaya ja sakey. itni baat zaroor hai ke wo nau-umr ladki hain ke aata goondhtii aur phir ja ke so rehti hai aur bakri aa kar usey kha leti hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (tohmat ke jhoot Sabit honey ke baad) farmaya ke aisey shakhs ki taraf se kon maafi talab karega jo meri biwi ke barey mein bhi mujhey takleef pahunchata hai. qism Allah ki! maine apne ghar mein khair ke siwa aur kuchh nahi dekha aur log aisey shakhs ka naam letey hain jiske mutaalliq bhi mujhey khair ke siwa aur kuchh malum nahi."
"2638","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ubai-bin-Kab Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ko sath lekar khajoor ke us baagh ki taraf tashrif le gaey jis mein ibne-Sayyaad tha. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baagh mein dakhil huey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) darakhton ki aad mein chhup kar chalney lagey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chahtey they ke ibne-Sayyaad aapko dekhney na paaey aur us se pahley aap uski baatein sun sakein. ibne-Sayyaad aik ro'ein-daar chadar mein zameen par leta hua tha aur kuchh gungunaa raha tha. ibne-Sayyaad ki maan ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh liya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) darakht ki aad liye chaley aa rahe hain to wo kehney lagi aey Saaf! ye Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aa rahe hain. ibne-Sayyaad hoshiyaar ho gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar usey apne haal par rehney deti to baat zahir ho jaatii.''"
"2639","main Rifaa ke nikah mein thi. phir mujhey unhon-ne talaaq de di aur qatae talaaq de di. phir maine Abdur-Rehman bin Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) se shadi kar li. lekin unke paas to (sharmgaah) us kapdey ki gaanth ki tarah hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum kya ''kya to Rifaa ke paas dobara jana chahti hai lekin to us waqt tak unse ab shadi nahi kar sakti jab tak to Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-Zubair ka mazaa na chakh ley aur wo tumhara mazaa na chakh lein.'' us waqt Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) khidmate-nabawii mein maujood they aur Khaalid-bin-Saeed-bin-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) darwazey par apne liye (andar aaney ki) ijazat ka intizar kar rahe they. unhon-ne kaha, abu-Bakar! kya us aurat ko nahi dekhtey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney kis tarah ki baatein zor-zor se keh rahi hai."
"2640","unhon-ne Abu-Abaab-bin-Azeez ki ladki se shadi ki thi. aik khatun aaiin aur kehney lagiin ke Aqba ko bhi maine doodh pilaya hai aur usey bhi jis se us ne shadi ki hai. Aqba (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mujhey to malum nahi ke aap ne mujhey doodh pilaya hai aur aap ne mujhey pahley is silsiley mein kuchh bataya bhi nahi tha. phir unhon-ne aal-Abu-Abaab ke yahan aadmi bheja ke unse iske mutaalliq poochhey. unhon-ne bhi yahi jawab diya ke hamein malum nahi ke unhon-ne doodh pilaya hai. Aqba (Raziallahu anhu) ab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein Madina hazir huey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se masla poochha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, ab kya ho sakta hai jabke kaha ja chukaa. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne donon mein judai kara di aur iska nikah doosrey shakhs se kara diya."
"2641","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein logon ka wahi ke zariey muaakhza ho jata tha. lekin ab wahiy ka silsila khatm ho gaya aur ham sirf unhiin maamlon mein poochh-gachh karengey jo tumharey amal se hamarey samney zahir hongey. isliye jo koi zahir mein hamarey samney khair karega, ham usey amn dengey aur apne qareeb rakhengey. iske baatin se hamein koi sarokaar na hoga. iska hisab to Allah Taala karega aur jo koi hamarey samney zahir mein burai karega to ham bhi usey amn nahi dengey aur na ham uski tasdeeq karengey chahe wo yahi kehta rahe ke iska baatin achchha hai."
"2642","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas se aik janaaza guzra to logon ne us maiyat ki tareef ki, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''waajib ho gaii'' phir doosra janaaza guzra to logon ne uski burai ki, ya uske siwa aur alfaz (usi mafhoom ko ada karne ke liye) kahey (raawii ko shuba hai) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par bhi farmaya ''waajib ho gaii'' arz kya gaya. ya Rasulullah! aap ne us janaaze ke mutaalliq bhi farmaya ke wajib ho gaee aur pahley janaaze par bhi yahi farmaya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya'' eman wali qaum ki gawahi (baargaahe-Ilaahii mein maqbool hai) ye log zameen par Allah ke gawah hain.''"
"2643","main Madina aaya to yahan wabaa phailii hui thi, log badi tezi se mar rahe they. main umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein tha ke aik janaaza guzraa. logon ne us maiyat ki tareef ki to umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke wajib ho gaee. phir doosra guzaar logon ne uski bhi tareef ki umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha wajib ho gaee. phir tesraa guzra to logon ne uski burai ki, umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne uske liye yahi kaha ke wajib ho gaee. maine puchha ameerul-momineen! kya wajib ho gaee. unhon-ne kaha ke maine isi tarah kaha hai jis tarah Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke jis musalman ke liye char aadmi achai ki gawahi de dein usey Allah Taala jannat mein dakhil karta hai. ham ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha aur agar teen dein? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke teen par bhii. ham ne puchha aur agar 2 aadmi gawahi dein ? farmaya 2 par bhii. phir ham ne aik ke mutaalliq Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se nahi poochha."
"2644","( parde ka hukm nazil honey ke baad) Aflah (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh se (ghar mein aaney ki) ijazat chahi to maine unko ijazat nahi di. wo boley ke aap mujh se parda karti hain halanke main aap ka (doodh k rishtey se) chacha hun. maine kaha ke ye kaisey? to unhon-ne bataya ke mere bhai (Waayel) ki aurat ne aapko mere bhai ka hi doodh pilaya tha. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke phir maine iske mutaalliq Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Aflah ne sach kaha hai. unhein (andar aaney ki) ijazat de diya karo (unse parda nahi hai)."
"2645","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hamza (Raziallahu anhu) ki sahibzadi ke mutaalliq farmaya ''ye mere liye halal nahi ho saktiin, jo rishtey nasb ki wjah se haram ho jatey hain, wahi doodh ki wjah se bhi haram ho jatey hain. ye to mere dudh-sharik (doodh-shareek) bhai ki ladki hai.''"
"2646","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke yahan tashrif farma they. Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) ne aik sahabi ki awaz suni jo ( Ummul-Momenin ( Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke ghar mein aaney ki ijazat chahta tha. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke maine kaha, ya Rasulullah ! mera khayal hai ye Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke dudh-sharik chacha hain. unhon-ne arz kya, ya Rasulullah ! ye sahabi aap ke ghar mein (jis mein Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) rehti hain) aaney ki ijazat maang rahe hain. unhon-ne bayan kya ke aap ne farmaya, mera khayal hai ye falan saahib, Hafsa ke dudh-sharik chacha hain. phir Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bhi apne aik dudh-sharik chacha ke mutaalliq puchha ke agar falan zinda hotey to kya wo be-hijaab mere paas aa saktey they? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya'' haan! doodh se bhi wo tamam rishtey haram ho jatey hain jo nasb ki wjah se haram hotey hain.''"
"2647","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( ghar mein) tashrif laey to mere yahan aik sahib (unke dudh-sharik bhai ( baithey huey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya, Aaisha ! ye kon hai? maine arz kya ke ye mera dudh-sharik bhai hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya Aaisha ! zara dekh bhaal kar lo, kon tumhara dudh-sharik bhai hai. kyonke razaat wahi moa'tabar hai jo kam-umrii mein ho, Muhammad-bin-Kaseer ke sath us hadis ko Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi ne Sufiyan Sory se riwayat kya hai."
"2648","aik aurat ne fateh Makka par chori kar li thi. phir usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir kya gaya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm ke mutabiq uska hath kaat diya gaya. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke phir unhon-ne achi tarah tauba kar li aur shadi kar li. iske baad wo aati thin to main unki zarurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kar diya karti thi."
"2649","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un logon ke liye jo shadi shuda na hon aur zina karein. ye hukm diya tha ke unhein so kode lagaey jayen aur aik saal ke liye jalaa watan kar diya jaey."
"2650","meri maan ne mere bap se mujhey aik cheez hiba dene ke liye kaha (pahley to unhon-ne inkar kya kyonke dusri biwi ke bhi aulad thi) phir razi ho gaey aur mujhey wo cheez hiba kar di. lekin maan ne kaha ke jab tak aap Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us maamle mein gawah na banaaein main is par razi na hongii. chunanche walid mera hath pakad kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey. main abhi nai umr ka tha. unhon-ne arz kya ke us ladkey ki maan Umra-bint-Rawaaha (Raziallahu anhu) mujh se aik cheez usey hiba karne ke liye keh rahi hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya iske ilawa aur bhi tumharey ladkey hain? unhon-ne kaha haan, hain. Nauman (Raziallahu anhu) ! ne bayan kya, mera khayal hai ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya '' to mujh ko zulm ki baat par gawah na banaa.'' aur abu-Hareez ne Shabi se ye naql kya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main zulm ki baat par gawah nahi bantaa.''"
"2651","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein sabse behtar mere zamane ke log ( sahaba ( hain. phir wo log jo unke baad aaeingey ( Tabe-een ( phir wo log jo iske bhi baad aaeingey. ( tabba' Tabe-een ( Imran ne bayan kya ke main nahi janta Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 2 zamanon ka (apne baad) zikr farmaya ya teen ka phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumharey baad aisey log paida hongey jo chor hongey, jin mein dayaanat ka naam na hoga. unse gawahi dene ke liye nahi kaha jaeyga lekin wo gawahiyan detey phirengey. nazrein maanengey lekin poori nahi karengey. mutaapaa unmein aam hoga.''"
"2652","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''sabse behtar mere zamane ke log hain, phir wo log jo iske baad hongey, phir wo log jo iske baad hongey aur uske baad aisey logon ka zamana aayega jo qism se pahley gawahi dengey aur gawahi se pahley qism khaaengey. ''Ibraaheem Nakhai (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne bayan kya ke hamarey badey buzurg shahadat aur ahad ka lafz zaban se nikalney par hamein maartey they."
"2653","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kabeera gunahon ke mutaalliq puchha gaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah ke sath kisi ko Sharik thehrana , maan-baap ki nafarmani karnaa, kisi ki jaan lena aur jhooti gawahi denaa.'' is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) ghandar , abu-Aamir , Behaz aur Abdus-Samad ne Shoba se ki hai."
"2654","main tum logon ko sabse badey gunah na bataaoon? teen baar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne isi tarah farmaya, sahaba ne arz kya, haan ya Rasulullah! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Allah ka kisi ko Sharik thehrana , maan-baap ki nafarmani karnaa, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt tak tek lagaey huey they lekin ab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) seedhey baith gaey aur farmaya, haan aur jhooti gawahi bhii. unhon-ne bayan kya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us jumley ko itni martaba dohraya ke ham kehney lagey kash! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khamosh ho jatey. Ismail bin Ibrahim ne bayan kya, unse Jurairi ne bayan kya, aur unse Abdur-Rehman ne bayan kya."
"2655","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ko masjid mein Quran padhtey suna to farmaya ke un par Allah Taala raham farmaai mujhey unhon-ne us waqt falan aur falan aayatein yad dila diin jinhein main falan-falan Suraton mein se bhool gaya tha. Ibaad-bin-Abdullaah (Raziallahu anhu) ne apni riwayat main Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se ye alfaz zyada bayan kiye hain ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mere ghar mein tahajjud ki Namaz padhi. us waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ibad (Raziallahu anhu) ki awaz suni ke wo masjid mein Namaz padh rahe hain. aap ne puchha Aaisha! kya ye Ibad ki awaz hai? maine kaha ji haan! aap ne farmaya, aey Allaah! Ibad par raham farmaa."
"2656","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Bilaal (Raziallahu anhu) raat mein azan detey hain. isliye tum log sehrii kha pi saktey ho yahan tak ke (fajr ke liye) dusri azan pukaarii jaaey.'' ya (ye farmaya) yahan tak ke ''Abdullaah-ibne-umme-Maktoom (Raziallahu anhu) ki azan sun lo.'' Abdullaah-ibne-umme-Maktoom (Raziallahu anhu) naa-beenaa they aur jab tak unse kaha na jata subah ho gaee hai, wo azan nahi detey they."
"2657","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan chand qubaaein aaiin to mujh se mere bap Makhrima (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mere sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein chalo. mumkin hai Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unmein se koi mujhey bhi inayat farmaaein. mere walid (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghar pahunch kar) darwazey par khadey ho gaey aur baatein karne lagey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki awaz pehchan li aur bahar tashrif laaey, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik Quba bhi thi, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uski khubiyan bayan karne lagey, aur farmaya ''maine ye tumharey hi liye alag kar rakhi thi, maine ye tumharey hi liye alag kar rakhi thii.''"
"2658","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kya aurat ki gawahi mard ki gawahi ke aadhey ke barabar nahi hai?'' ham ne arz kya kyon nahi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''yahii to unki aql ka nuqsan hai.''"
"2659","unhon-ne umme-Yahyaa-binte-abii-Ahaab se shadi ki thi. unhon-ne bayan kya ke phir aik siyah rang wali baandi aai aur kehney lagi ke maine tum donon ko doodh pilaya hai. maine iska zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne meri taraf se munh pher liya isliye main juda ho gaya. maine phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney ja kar iska zikr kya, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, ab (nikaah) kaisey (baqi reh sakta hai) jabke tumhen us aurat ne bata diya hai ke usne tum donon ko doodh pilaya tha. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein umme-Yahyaa ko apne sath rakhney se mana farma diya."
"2660","maine aik aurat se shadi ki thi. phir aik aurat aai aur kehney lagi ke maine tum donon ko doodh pilaya tha. isliye main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab tumhen bata diya gaya (ke aik hi aurat tum donon ki doodh Sharik maan hai) to phir ab aur kya sura ho sakti hai apni biwi ko apne se juda kar de.'' ya isi tarah ke alfaz Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaaey."
"2661","wo qissa bayan kya jab tohmat lagaaney walon ne un par tohmat lagai lekin Allah Taala ne khud unhein us se barii qarar diya. Zohri ne bayan kya (ke Zohri se bayan karne waale, jinki sanad mein Zohri ke baad zikr hai) tamam rawiyon ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki us hadis ka eik-eik hissey bayan kya tha, kuchh rawiyon ko kuchh doosrey rawiyon se hadis zyada yad thi aur wo bayan bhi zyada behtar tareeqe par kar saktey they. bahar-haal un sab rawiyon se maine ye hadis poori tarah mehfooz kar li thi jisey wo Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se bayan kartey they. un rawiyon mein har aik ki riwayat se doosrey rawi ki tasdeeq hoti thi. unka bayan tha ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab safar mein janey ka irada kartey to apni beeviyon ke darmyan Qura daaltey. jiske naam ka Qura nikaltaa, safar mein wahi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath jati. chunanche aik jang ke mauqe par, jis mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi shirkat kar rahe they, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Qura dalwaayaa aur mera naam niklaa. ab main Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath thi. ye waqia pardey ki aayat ke nazil honey ke baad ka hai. khair main aik hodaj mein sawar rehti thi, usi mein baithey-baithey mujh ko utara jata tha. is tarah ham chaltey rahe. phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jihad se farigh ho kar wapas huey aur ham Madina ke qareeb pahunch gaey to aik raat aap ne kooch ka hukm diya. main ye hukm suntey hi uthi aur lashkar se aagey badh gaee. jab haajat se farigh hui to kajaawey ke paas aa gaee. wahan pahunch kar jo maine apna Sina tatolaa to mera zifaar ke kaley nageenon ka haar maujood nahi tha. isliye main wahan dobara pahunchi (jahaan qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye gaee thi) aur maine haar ko talash kya. us talash mein der ho gaee. us waqt mein wo ashaab jo mujhey sawar karatey they, aaey aur mera hodaj utha kar mere oont par rakh diya. wo yahi samjhey ke main usmein baithi hun. un dinon auratein halki phulkii hoti thin, bhari bhar kam nahi. gosht unmein zyada nahi rehta tha kyonke bahut maamooli ghizaa khaatii thin. isliye un logon ne jab hodaj ko uthaya to unhein iske bojh mein koi farq malum nahi hua. mein yun bhi nau-umr ladki thi. chunanche ashaab ne oont ko haank diya aur khud bhi uske sath chalney lagey. jab lashkar rawaana ho chuka to mujhey apna haar mila aur main padao ki jagah aai. lekin wahan koi aadmi maujood na tha. isliye main us jagah gaee jahan pahley mera qiyam tha. mera khayal tha ke jab wo log mujhey nahi paaengey to yahin lot ke aaeingey. Mina (apni jagah pahunch kar) main yun hi baithi hui thi ke meri aankh lag gaee aur main so gaee. Safwaan-bin-Muattal (Raziallahu anhu) jo pahley Sulami they phir zakwaanii ho gaey lashkar ke peechhey they (jo lashkariyon ki giri padi chizon ko utha kar unhein uske Malik tak pahunchaney ki khidmat ke liye muqarrar they) wo meri taraf se guzrey to aik soey huey insan ka saaya nazar padaa isliye aur qareeb pahunchey. parde ke hukm se pahley wo mujhey dekh chukey they. unke (inna-lillah) padhney se main bedaar ho gaee. aakhir unhon-ne apna oont bithaya aur uske agley paon ko mod diya (taake bila kisi madad ke main khud Sawar ho sakoon) chunanche main Sawar ho gaee, ab wo oont par mujhey bithaaey huey khud uske aagey-aagey chalney lagey. isi tarah ham jab lashkar ke qareeb pahunchey to log bhari do-pahar mein aaraam ke liye padao daal chukey they. (itni hi baat thi jiski buniyad par) jisey halaak hona tha wo halaak hua aur tohmat ke mamley mein pesh-pesh Abdullaah-bin-Ubaii-ibn-Salool (munaafiq) tha. phir ham Madina mein aagey aur main aik mahiney tak bimar rahi. tohmat lagaaney walon ki baton ka khub charcha ho raha tha. apni us bimari ke doran mujhey us se bhi bada shuba hota tha ke un dinon Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka wo lutf w karam bhi main nahi dekhti thi jinka mushaahida apni pichhli beemaariyon mein kar chuki thi. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghar mein jab aatey to salam kartey aur sirf itna malum farma letey, mizaaj kaisa hai? jo baatein tohmat lagaaney waley phaila rahe they unmein se koi baat mujhey malum nahi thi. jab meri sihat kuchh theek hui to (eik raat) main umme-mistah ke sath manase ki taraf gaee. ye hamari qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ki jagah thi, ham yahan sirf raat hi mein aatey they. ye us zamana ki baat hai jab abhi hamarey gharon ke qareeb baitul-khala nahi baney they. maidan mein janey ke silsiley mein (qazaaey haajat ke liye) hamara tarze-amal puraaney Arab ki tarah tha, main aur umme-Mistah-bint-abii-Raham chal rahi thi ke wo apni chadar mein ulajh kar gir padiin aur unki zaban se nikal gaya, mistah barbad ho. maine kaha, buri baat aap ne apni zaban se nikaalii, aisey shakhs ko bura keh rahi hain aap, jo badr ki ladai mein Sharik tha, wo kehney lagiin, aey bholii-bhaalii! jo kuchh un sab ne kaha hai wo aap ne nahi suna, phir unhon-ne tohmat lagaaney walon ki saari baatein sunain aur un baton ko sun kar meri bimari aur badh gaee. main jab apne ghar wapas hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) andar tashrif laey aur malum farmaya, mizaaj kaisa hai? maine arz kya ke aap mujhey waalidain ke yahan janey ki ijazat dijiye. us waqt mera irada ye tha ke unse us khabar ki tahqeeq karoongii. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey janey ki ijazat de di aur main jab ghar aai to maine apni walida (umme- roomaan) se un baton ke mutaalliq poochha, jo logon mein phailii hui thin. Mina unhon-ne farmaya, betii! is tarah ki baton ki parwah na kar, Allah ki qism ! shayad hi aisa ho ke tujh jaisi Husain w khoobsurat aurat kisi mard ke ghar mein ho aur uski saukanein bhi hon, phir bhi is tarah ki baatein na phailaaii jaya karein. maine kaha Subhan-Allah ! ( sokanon ka kya zikr ( wo to doosrey log is tarah ki baatein kar rahe hain. unhon-ne bayan kya ke wo raat maine wahin guzaarii, subah tak mere aansu nahi thamtey they aur na neend aai. subah hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni biwi ko juda karne ke silsiley mein mashwara karne ke liye Ali ibne- abii-Taalib aur Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ko bulwaya . kyonke wahi (is silsiley mein) ab tak nahi aai thi. Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ko aap ki beeviyon se aap ki mohabbat ka ilm tha. isliye usi ke mutabiq mashwara diya aur kaha, aap ki biwi , ya Rasulullah ! Allah ki qasam, ham unke mutaalliq khair ke siwa aur kuchh nahi jaantey. Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ya Rasulullah ! Allah Taala ne aap par koi tangi nahi ki hai, auratein unke siwa bhi bahut hain, baandi se bhi aap malum farma liijiye, wo sachchii baat bayan karengii. chunanche Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ko bulaya (jo Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki khas khaadima thi) aur malum farmaya, Barira ! kya tum ne Aaisha mein koi aisi cheez dekhi hai jis se tumhen shuba hua ho. Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya, nahi, us zaat ki qism jisne aapko haq ke sath maboos farmaya hai. maine unmein koi aisi cheez nahi dekhi jiska aib mein un par laga sakun . itni baat zaroor hai ke wo nau-umr ladki hain. aata goondh kar so jati hain phir bakri aati hai aur kha leti hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne isi din ( member par) khadey ho kar Abdullaah-bin-Ubaii-ibne-Salool ke barey mein madad chahi . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, aik aisey shakhs ke barey mein meri kon madad karega jiski azeeyat aur takleef dahii ka silsile ab meri biwi ke mamley tak pahunch chuka hai. Mina Allah ki qasam, apni biwi ke barey mein khair ke siwa aur koi cheez mujhey malum nahi. phir naam bhi us mamley mein unhon-ne aik aisey aadmi ka liya hai jiske mutaalliq bhi mein khair ke siwa aur kuchh nahi janta. khud mere ghar mein jab bhi wo aaey hain to mere sath hi aaey. (ye sun kar) Sad-bin-Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey aur arz kya, ya Rasulullah ! Allah ki qism main aap ki madad karunga . agar wo shakhs ( jiske mutaalliq tohmat lagaaney ka aap ne irshad farmaya hai) Aus qabeele se hoga to ham uski gardan mar dengey (kyonke Sad (Raziallahu anhu) khud qabila Aus ke sardaar they) aur agar wo khazraj ka aadmi hua, to aap hamein hukm dein, jo bhi aap ka hukm hoga ham ta'meel karengey. iske baad Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey jo qabila khazraj ke sardaar they. halanke us se pahley ab tak bahut Saleh they. lekin us waqt ( Sad-bin-Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ki baat par) hamiiyat se ghussa ho gaey they aur (Sa'd bin Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) se) kehney lagey rab ke dawaam w baqaa ki qasam! tum jhoot boltey ho, na tum usey qatl kar saktey ho aur na tumharey andar uski taqat hai. phir Usaid-bin-Huzair (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey (Sa'd bin Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ke chacha zaad bhai (aur kaha, Allah ki qism ! ham usey qatl kar dengey (agar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka hukm hua) koi shuba nahi reh jata ke tum bhi munafiq ho. kyonke munaafiqon ki tarafdaar kar rahe ho. is par Aus w khazraj donon qabeelon ke log uth khadey huey aur aagey badhney hi waley they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jo abhi tak member par tashrif rakhtey they. member se utrey aur logon ko narm kya. ab sab log khamosh ho gaey aur aap bhi khamosh ho gaey. mein us din bhi roti rahi. na mere aansu thamtey they aur na neend aati thi phir mere paas mere maan-baap aaey. mein aik raat aur aik din se barabar roti rahi thi. aisa malum hota tha ke rotey-rotey mere dil ke tukdey ho jaengey. unhon-ne bayan kya ke maan-baap mere paas baithey huey they ke aik Ansari aurat ne ijazat chahi aur maine unhein andar aaney ki ijazat de di aur wo mere sath baith kar roney lagiin . ham sab isi tarah they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) andar tashrif laey aur baith gaey. jis din se mere mutaalliq wo baatein kahi ja rahi thin jo kabhi nahi kahi gain thin. us din se mere paas aap nahi baithey they. Mina Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik mahiney tak intizar kartey rahe they. lekin mere mamley mein koi wahi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par nazil nahi hui thi. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tashahud padhi aur farmaya, Aaisha ! tumharey mutaalliq mujhey ye ye baatein malum huin. agar tum us mamley mein barii ho to Allah Taala bhi tumhari Bara't (Tauba) zahir kar dega aur agar tum ne gunah kya hai to Allah Taala se maghfirat chaho aur uske huzoor tauba karo ke banda jab apne gunah ka iqrar karke tauba karta hai to Allah Taala bhi uski tauba qabool karta hai. junhii Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni guftgu khatm ki, mere aansu is tarah khushk ho gaey ke ab aik qatra bhi mehsus nahi hota tha. maine apne bap se kaha ke aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mere mutaalliq kahey . lekin unhon-ne kaha, qism Allah ki ! mujhey nahi malum ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mujhey kya kehna chahiye maine apni maan se kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jo kuchh farmaya, iske mutaalliq Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aap hi kuchh kahiye, unhon-ne bhi yahi farma diya ke qism Allah ki! mujhey malum nahi ke mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya kehna chahiye unhon-ne bayan kya ke main nau-umr ladki thi. Quran mujhey zyada yad nahi tha. maine kaha Allah gawah hai, mujhey malum hua ke aap logon ne bhi logon ki afawaah suni hain aur aap logon ke dilon mein wo baat baith gaee hai aur uski tasdeeq bhi aap log kar chukey hain, isliye ab agar main kahun ke main (is bohtan se) barii hun, aur Allah khub janta hai ke main waqei us se barii hun to aap log meri us mamley mein tasdeeq nahi karengey. lekin agar main ( gunah ko) apne zimma ley loon, halanke Allah Taala khub janta hai ke main us se barii hon, to aap log meri baat ki tasdeeq kar dengey. qism Allah ki! mein us waqt apni aur aap logon ki koi misal Yusuf (Alaihissalam) ke walid ( Yaqoob (Alaihissalam) (ke siwa nahi paatii ke unhon-ne bhi farmaya thaa (فصبر جميل والله المستعان على ما تصفون) ''sabr hi behtar hai aur jo kuchh tum kehtey ho us mamley mein mera madadgaar Allah Taala hai''. iske baad bistar par maine apna rukh dusri taraf kar liya aur mujhey ummeed thi ke khud Allah Taala meri Bara't (Tauba) karega . lekin mera ye khayal kabhi na tha ke mere mutaalliq wahi nazil hogi. meri apni nazar mein haisiyat us se bahut maamooli thi ke Quran Majeed mein mere mutaalliq koi aayat nazil ho. haan mujhey itni ummeed zaroor thi ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) koi khuwab dekhengey jis mein Allah Taala mujhey barii farma dega. Mina Allah gawah hai ke abhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni jagah se uthey bhi na they aur na us waqt ghar mein maujood koi bahar nikla tha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wahi nazil honey lagi aur) shiddat wahi se) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jis tarah pasiney paseeney ho jaya kartey they wahi kaifiyat Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ab bhi thi. pasiney ke qatrey motiyon ki tarah Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke jism Mubarak se girney lagey. halanke sardi ka mausam tha. jab wahi ka silsile khatm hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hans rahe they aur sabse pahlaa kalima jo aap ki zaban Mubarak se nikla, wo ye tha aey Aaisha ! Allah ki hamd bayan karke usne tumhen barii qarar de diya hai. meri walida ne kaha beti ja , Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney ja kar khadi ho jaa. maine kaha, nahi qism Allah ki main aap ke paas ja kar khadi na hongi aur main to sirf Allah ki hamd w sana karoongii. Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil farmai thii (إن الذين جاءوا بالإفك عصبة منكم‏)'' jin logon ne tohmat tarashi ki hai. wo tum hi mein se kuchh log hain ''. jab Allah Taala ne meri Bara't (Tauba) mein ye aayat nazil farmai to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne jo Mistah-bin-Asaasa (Raziallahu anhu) ke ikhraajaat qaraabat ki wjah se khud hi uthatey they kaha ke qism Allah ki ab main mistah par kabhi koi cheez kharch nahi karunga ke wo bhi Aaisha par tohmat lagaaney mein Sharik tha. is par Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil ki ولا يأتل أولو al-Fazal منكم والسعة‏ إلى قوله ghafoor رحيم''tum mein se saahibe-fazal w saahibe-maal log qism na khaaein. Allah Taala ke irshad ghafoor aur Rahim tak '' abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha Allah ki qism ! bas meri yahi khahish hai ke Allah Taala meri maghfirat kar de. chunanche mistah (Raziallahu anhu) ko jo aap pahley diya kartey they wo phir dene lagey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zenab binte-Jahash ( (Raziallahu anhu) Ummul-Momenin ( se bhi mere mutaalliq puchha tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke Zenab ! tum ( Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke mutaalliq ( kya janti ho? aur kya dekha hai? unhon-ne jawab diya main apne kaan aur apni aankh ki hifazat karti hun (ke jo cheez maine dekhi ho ya na suni ho wo aap se bayan karne lagoon ( Allah gawah hai ke maine unmein khair ke siwa aur kuchh nahi dekha. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke yahi meri barabar ki thin, lekin Allah Taala ne unhein taqwa ki wjah se bacha liya. abu-Rabee' ne bayan kya ke ham se Fulaih ne bayan kya, unse Hisham-bin-Urwa ne, unse Urwa ne, unse Aaisha aur Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ne usi hadis ki tarah . abu-Rabee' ne (doosri sanad mein) bayan kya ke ham se Fulaih ne bayan kya, unse Rabee bin abi Abdur-Rehman aur Yahya-bin-Saeed ne aur unse Qasim-bin-Muhammad -bin-abi-Bakr ne usi hadis ki tarah ."
"2662","aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney doosrey shakhs ki tareef ki, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya afsos! tu ney apne sathi ki gardan kaat daalii. tu ney apne sathi ki gardan kaat daalii. kai martaba (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne isi tarah farmaya) phir farmaya ke agar kisi ke liye apne kisi bhai ki tareef karni zaroori ho jaey to yun kahey ke main falan shakhs ko aisa samajhta hon, aagey Allah khub janta hai, main Allah ke samney kisi ko be-aeib nahi keh sakta. main samajhta hun wo aisa aisaa hai agar iska haal janta ho."
"2663","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne suna ke aik shakhs doosrey ki tareef kar raha tha aur mubaalghe se kaam ley raha tha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum logon ne us shakhs ko halaak kar diya. uski pusht tod di."
"2664","Uhud ki ladai ke mauqe par wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney (jang par janey ke liye) pesh huey to unhein ijazat nahi milii, us waqt unki umr chaudah saal thi. phir Khandaq ki jang ke mauqe par pesh huey to ijazat mil gaee. us waqt unki umr pandarah saal thi. Naafe ne bayan kya ke jab main Umar-bin-abdul-Azeez ke yahan unki khilafat ke zamaney mein gaya to maine unse ye hadis bayan ki to unhon-ne farmaya ke chhotey aur badey ke darmyan (pandarah saal hi ki) had hai. phir unhon-ne apne haakimon ko likha ke jis bachchey ki umr pandarah saal ki ho jaey (uska fauji wazeefa) baitul-maal se muqarrar kar dein."
"2665","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''har baligh par Jume' ke din ghusl wajib hai.''"
"2666","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jis shakhs ne koi aisi qism khaaii jis mein wo jhoota tha, kisi musalman ka maal chheenney ke liye, to wo Allah Taala se is tarah milega ke Allah Taala is par ghazabnaak hoga.'' unhon-ne bayan kya ke is par ash'as-bin-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah gawah hai, ye hadis mere hi mutaalliq Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmai thi. mera aik Yahudi se aik zameen ka jhagdaa tha. Yahudi mere haq ka inkar kar raha tha. isliye main usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein laya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya (kyonke main muddaii tha) ke gawahi pesh karna tumharey hi zimme hai. unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya gawah to mere paas koi bhi nahi. isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Yahudi se farmaya ''phir tum qism khaao.'' ash'as (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke main bol padaa, ya Rasulullah! phir to ye qism kha lega aur mera maal Hazam kar jaeyga unhon-ne bayan kya ke isi waqia par Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil farmaaii ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا ) ''jo log Allah ke ahad aur qasmon se maamooli poonjii khareedtey hain aakhir aayat tak. ''"
"2667","rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jis shakhs ne koi aisi qism khaaii jis mein wo jhoota tha, kisi musalman ka maal chheenney ke liye, to wo Allah Taala se is tarah milega ke Allah Taala is par ghazabnaak hoga.'' unhon-ne bayan kya ke is par ash'as-bin-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah gawah hai, ye hadis mere hi mutaalliq Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmai thi. mera aik Yahudi se aik zameen ka jhagdaa tha. Yahudi mere haq ka inkar kar raha tha. isliye main usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein laya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya (kyonke main muddaii tha) ke gawahi pesh karna tumharey hi zimme hai. unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya gawah to mere paas koi bhi nahi. isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Yahudi se farmaya ''phir tum qism khaao.'' ash'as (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke main bol padaa, ya Rasulullah! phir to ye qism kha lega aur mera maal Hazam kar jaeyga unhon-ne bayan kya ke isi waqia par Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil farmaaii ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا ) ''jo log Allah ke ahad aur qasmon se maamooli poonjii khareedtey hain aakhir aayat tak. ''"
"2668","Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne likha tha ''nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mudduaa-alaih ke liye qism khaney ka faisla kya tha.''"
"2669","Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke jo shakhs ( jhooti ( qism kisi ka maal hasil karne ke liye khaaeyga to Allah Taala se wo us haal mein milega ke Allah paak is par ghazabnaak hoga. iske baad Allah Taala ne (is hadis ki) tasdeeq ke liye ye aayat nazil farmaaii ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم‏ ) ''jo log Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon se thodi poonjii khareedtey hain. ( azaabe-aleem)'' tak. phir Ash'as-bin-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) hamari taraf tashrif laey aur poochhney lagey ke abu-Abdur-Rehman ( Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) tum se kon si hadis bayan kar rahe they. ham ne unki yahi hadis bayan ki to unhon-ne kaha ke unhon-ne sahi bayan ki, ye aayat mere hi barey mein nazil hui thi. mera aik shakhs se jhagdaa tha. ham apna muqaddima Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas le gaey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ya tum 2 gawah laao, warna uski qism par faisla hoga. maine kaha ke (gawaah mere paas nahi hain lekin agar faisla uski qism par hua) phir to ye zaroor hi qism kha lega aur koi parwah na karega. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye sun kar farmaya ''jo shakhs bhi kisi ka maal leney ke liye ( jhooti ( qism khaaey to Allah Taala se wo us haal mein milega ke wo is par ghazabnaak hoga.'' uski tasdeeq mein Allah Taala ne uper zikr ki gaee aayat nazil farmai thi, phir unhon-ne yahi aayat tilawat ki."
"2738","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kisi musalman ke liye jinke paas wasiiyat ke qaabil koi bhi maal ho durust nahi ke 2 raat bhi wasiiyat ko likh kar apne paas mehfooz rakhey baghair guzaarey.'' Imam Malik ke sath is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Muhammad-bin-Muslim ne Amr-bin-Dinar se ki hai, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki hai."
"2739","aur unse Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke nisbatii bhai Amr-bin-Haris (Raziallahu anhu) ne jo Juweriya binte- Haris (Raziallahu anhu)) Ummul-Momenin (ke bhai hain, bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni wafat ke baad siwaey apne safaid khachchar , apne hathiyar aur apni zameen ke jisey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) waqf kar gaey they na koi dirham chhoda tha na Dinar na ghulam na baandi aur na koi cheez ."
"2740","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne koi wasiiyat ki thi? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi. is par maine puchha ke phir wasiiyat kis tarah logon par farz huii? ya ( rawi ne is tarah bayan kya (ke logon ko wasiiyat ka hukm kyon kar diya gayaa? unhon-ne kaha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon ko kitabullah par amal karne ki wasiiyat ki thi."
"2741","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke yahan kuchh logon ne zikr kya ke Ali (Raziallahu anhu) (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke) wasii they, to aap ne kaha ke Kab unhein wasii banaya. main to aap ke wisaal ke waqt sar Mubarak apne seeney par ya unhon-ne (bajaaey seeney ke) kaha ke apne god mein rakhey huey thi phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (pani ka ( tasht mangwaya tha ke itney main ( sar Mubarak ( meri god mein jhuk gaya aur main samajh na saki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ho chuki hai to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko wasii Kab banaya."
"2742","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (hijjatul-wadaa mein) meri iyaadat ko tashrif laaey, mein us waqt Makka mein tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us sar-zameen par maut ko pasand nahi farmatey they jahan se koi hijrat kar chuka ho. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allaah-ibn-Ifraa (Sa'd bin Khaula (Raziallahu anhu)) par raham farmaaey.'' mein arz kya ya Rasulullah ! main apne sarey maal w daulat ki wasiiyat kar dun. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' nahi '' maine puchha phir aadhey ki kar dun? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par bhi yahi farmaya '' nahi '' maine puchha phir tehai ki kar dun. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tehai ki kar saktey ho aur ye bhi bahut hai, agar tum apne waarison ko apne peechhey maaldaar chhodo to ye us se behtar hai ke unhein mohtaaj chhodo ke logon ke samney hath phailaatey phirein, ismein koi shuba nahi ke jab tum apni koi cheez ( Allah ke liye kharch karogey ( to wo khairat hai, yahan tak ke wo luqma bhi jo tum apni biwi ke munh mein daalogey (wo bhi khairat hai) aur) abhi wasiiyat karne ki koi zarurat bhi nahi ( mumkin hai ke Allah Taala tumhen shifa de aur uske baad tum se bahut se logon ko fayda ho aur doosrey bahut se log (Islam ke mukhaalif) nuqsan uthaaein. us waqt Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ki sirf aik beti thi."
"2743","kash! log (wasiiyat ko) chothai tak kam kar detey to behtar hota kyonke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ''tum tehai (ki wasiiyat kar saktey ho) aur tehai bhi bahut hai.'' ya (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya ke) ''ye bahut zyada raqam hai.''"
"2744","main Makka mein bimar padaa to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) meri iyaadat ke liye tashrif laey. maine arz kya ya Rasulullah ! mere liye dua kijiye ke Allah mujhey ultey paon wapas na kar de (yani Makka mein meri maut na ho (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya mumkin hai ke Allah Taala tumhen sihat de aur tum se bahut se log nafa uthaaein. maine arz kya mera irada wasiiyat karne ka hai. aik ladki ke siwa aur mere koi ( aulad ( nahi. maine puchha kya aadhey maal ki wasiiyat kar dun? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aadha to bahut hai. phir maine puchha to tehai ki kar dun? farmaya ke tehai ki kar saktey ho agarche ye bhi bahut hai ya (ye farmaya ke) badi ( raqam ( hai. chunanche log bhi tehai ki wasiiyat karne lagey aur ye unke liye jaaiz ho gaee."
"2745","Utba-bin- abii-waqaas ne martey waqt apne bhai Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) ko wasiiyat ki thi ke Zam-aa ki baandi ka ladka mera hai, isliye tum usey ley lena chunanche fateh Makka ke mauqe par Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey ley liya aur kaha ke mere bhai ka ladka hai. unhon-ne us barey mein mujhey uski wasiiyat ki thi. phir abd-bin-Zam'a (Raziallahu anhu) uthey aur kehney lagey ke ye to mera bhai hai mere bap ki londi ne usko janaa hai aur mere bap ke bistar par paida hua hai. phir ye donon Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey. Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ya Rasulullah ! ye mere bhai ka ladka hai, mujhey us ne wasiiyat ki thi. lekin abd-bin-Zam'a (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke ye mera bhai aur mere walid ki baandi ka ladka hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne faisla ye farmaya ke ladka tumhara hi hai abd-bin-Zam'a ! bachcha faraash ke tehet hota hai aur zaanii ke hissey mein patthar hain lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Sauda-binte-Zama (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya ke us ladkey se parda kar kyonke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Utba ki mushabihat (similarity) us ladkey mein saaf paai thi. chunanche iske baad us ladkey ne Sauda (Raziallahu anha) ko kabhi na dekha yahan tak ke aap Allah Taala se ja miliin."
"2746","aik Yahudi ne aik ( Ansari ( ladki ka sar 2 pattharon ke darmyan mein rakh kar kuchal diya tha. ladki se puchha gaya ke tumhara sar is tarah kis ne kya hai? kya falan shakhs ne kya? falan ne kya? aakhir Yahudi ka bhi naam liya gaya (jisne uska sar kuchal diya tha) to ladki ne sar ke ishaarey se haan mein jawab diya. phir wo Yahudi bulaya gaya aur aakhir usne bhi iqrar kar liya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se iska bhi patthar se sar kuchal diya gaya."
"2747","shuru Islam mein (meeraas ka ( maal aulad ko milta tha aur waalidain ke liye wasiiyat zaroori thi, lekin Allah Taala ne jis tarah chaha us hukm ko mansukh kar diya phir ladkey ka hissa 2 ladkiyon ke barabar qarar diya aur waalidain mein se har aik ka chhataa hissey aur biwi ka (aulaad ki maujoodgii mein) aathwaan hissey aur (aulaad ke na honey ki sura mein) chotha hissey qarar diya. isi tarah shauhar ka (aulaad na honey ki sura mein) aadha (aulaad honey ki sura mein) chothai hissey qarar diya."
"2748","aik sahabi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ya Rasulullah ! kon sa sadqa afzal hai? farmaya ye ke sadqe tandurustii ki haalat mein karke (tujh ko us maal ko baqi rakhney ki) khahish bhi ho jis se kuchh sarmaaya jama ho janey ki tumhen ummeed ho aur (usey kharch karne ki sura mein) mohtaajii ka dar ho aur is mein taakheer na karke jab Rooh halaq tak pahunch jaey to kehney baith jaey ke itna maal falan ke liye, fulaaney ko itna denaa, ab to fulaaney ka ho hi gaya (to to duniya se chalaa)."
"2749","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''munaafiq ki teen nishaniyan hain jab baat kahey to jhoot kahey aur jab uske paas amanat rakhein to khayanat karey aur jab wada karey to khilaf kare.''"
"2750","Hakeem-bin-Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu)) mashhoor sahabi ( ne bayan kya maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se maanga aap ne mujh ko diya, phir maanga phir aap ne diya, phir farmaney lagey hakeem ye duniya ka rupya-paisaa dekhney mein khushnumaa aur mazey mein meetha hai lekin jo koi usko sair chashmii se ley usko barkat hoti hai aur jo koi jaan lada kar hirs ke sath usko ley usko barkat na hogi. uski misal aisi hai jo kamaataa hai lekin sair nahi hota uper wala (dene wala) hath nichey waley (leney waale) hath se behtar hai. hakeem ne arz kya ya Rasulullah! qism uski jisne aapko sachcha paighambar karke bheja hai main to aaj se aap ke baad kisi se koi cheez kabhi nahi loonga marney tak phir ( hakeem ka ye haal raha (ke Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) unka saalaana wazeefa dene ke liye unko bulaatey, wo usko leney se inkar kartey. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi apni khilafat mein unko bulaya unka wazeefa dene ke liye lekin unhon-ne inkar kya. umr (Raziallahu anhu) kehney lagey musalmaanon ! tum gawah rehna hakeem ko uska haq jo ghaneemat ke maal mein Allah ne rakha hai deta hun wo nahi letaa. gharaz hakeem ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad phir kisi shakhs se koi cheez qabool nahi ki (apnaa wazeefa bhi baitul-maal mein na liyaa) yahan tak ke unki wafat ho gaee. Allah un par raham kare."
"2751","maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they tum mein se har koi nigahbaan hai aur apni raiyat ke barey mein puchha jaeyga Hakim bhi nigahbaan hai apni raiyat ke barey mein puchha jaeyga aur mard apne ghar walon ka nigahbaan hai aur apni raiyat ke barey mein puchha jaeyga aur aurat apne khawind ke ghar ki nigahbaan hai apni raiyat ke barey mein poochhi jaeygi aur ghulam apne sahib ke maal ka nigahbaan hai aur apni raiyat ke barey mein puchha jaeyga ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main samajhta hun Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye bhi farmaya ke mard apne bap ke maal ka nigahbaan hai aur apni raiyat ke barey mein puchha jaeyga"
"2752","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne abu-Talha se farmaya (jab unhon-ne apna beerhaa ka baagh Allah ki raah mein dena chaha ( mein munasib samajhta hun to ye baagh apne azeezon ko de-dey. abu-Talha ne kaha bahut khub aisa hi karunga. phir abu-Talha ne wo baagh apne azeezon aur chacha ke beton mein taqseem kar diya aur Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha jab ( sura shau'raa ki) ye aayat utri ( وأنذر عشيرتك الأقربين‏ ( aur apne qareeb ke rishtedaron ko) Allah ke azab se) daraa"" to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Quraish ke khandanon bani fahar"
"2753","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha jab ( sura Shau'raa ki) ye aayat Allah Taala ne utari ( وأنذر عشيرتك الأقربين‏ (aur apne nazdeek rishtedaron ko Allah ke azab se dara to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya Quraish ke logo! ya aisa hi koi aur kalima tum log apni apni jaanon ko (nek aamaal ke badal) mol ley lo (bachaa lo) mein Allah ke samney tumharey kuchh kaam nahi aaoonga (yani uski marzii ke khilaf main kuchh nahi kar sakoonga) abd munaaf ke beto! main Allah ke samney tumharey kuchh kaam nahi aaoonga. Abbas abdul-Muttalib ke betey! main Allah ke samney tumharey kuchh kaam nahi aaoonga. Safiya meri phoophii ! Allah ke samney tumharey kuchh kaam nahi aaoonga. Faatima! beti to chahey mera maal maang ley lekin Allah ke samney terey kuchh kaam nahi aaoonga. abul-Yamaan ke sath hadis ko asbagh ne bhi Abdullaah-bin-Wahab se, unhon-ne Yunus se, unhon-ne ibne-Shahab se riwayat kya."
"2754","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dekha ke aik shakhs qurbani ka oont haankey liye ja raha hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke is par Sawar ho jaa. us sahib ne kaha ya Rasulullah ! ye qurbani ka oont hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teesri ya chothi baar farmaya afsos ! sawar bhi ho ja ya aap ne ( ويلك ( ki bajaey ( ويحك ( farmaya jiske mana bhi wahi hain."
"2755","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dekha ke aik sahib qurbani ka oont haankey liye ja rahe hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is par Sawar ho ja lekin unhon-ne ma'zirat ki ke ya Rasulullah! ye to qurbani ka hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir farmaya ke sawar bhi ho jaa. afsos! ye kalima Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teesri ya chothi martaba farmaya tha."
"2756","Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ki maan Umra-binte-Mas'ood ka intiqal hua to wo unki khidmat mein maujood nahi they. unhon-ne aa kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ya Rasulullah! meri walida ka jab intiqal hua to main unki khidmat mein hazir nahi tha. kya agar main koi cheez sadqa karun to us se unhein fayda pahunch sakta hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jawab diya : haan. to unhon-ne kaha ke main aapko gawah banata hun ke mera mikhraaf naam ke baagh unki taraf se sadqa hai."
"2757","maine Kab-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo bayan kartey they ke maine arz kya ya Rasulullah! meri tauba (jange-Tabook mein na janey ki) qabool honey ka shukraana ye hai ke main apna maal Allah aur uske rasool ke rastey mein dee-doon. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar apne maal ka aik hissey apne paas hi baqi rakho to tumharey haq mein ye behtar hai. maine arz kya ke phir main apna khaibar ka hissa apne paas mehfooz rakhta hun."
"2758","ye riwayat unhon-ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se ki hai ke unhon-ne bayan kya (jab sura Aale-Imran ki) ye aayat nazil huii (لن تنالوا البر حتى تنفقوا مما تحبون) ''tum neki hargiz nahi pa saktey jab tak us maal mein se kharch na karo jo tum ko zyada pasand hai.'' to abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya ya Rasulullah! Allah tabarak w taala apni kitab mein farmata hai (لن تنالوا البر حتى تنفقوا مما تحبون) ''tum neki hargiz nahi pa saktey jab tak us maal mein se kharch na karo jo tum ko zyada pasand hai.'' aur mere amwaal mein sabse pasand mujhey beerhaa hai. bayan kya ke beerhaa aik baagh tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi usmein tashrif ley jaya kartey, iske saaey mein baithtey aur uska pani peetey (abu-Talha ne kaha ke) isliye wo izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ki raah mein sadqa aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye hai. main uski neki aur uske zakheerae-aakhirat honey ki ummeed rakhta hun. isliye ya Rasulullah ! jis tarah Allah aapko bataaey usey kharch keejiye. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya waah! waah, shaabaash! abu-Talha ye to bada nafa bakhsh maal hai, ham tum se usey qabool karke phir tumharey hi hawale kar detey hain aur ab tum usey apne azeezon ko de-do. chunanche abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne wo baagh apne azeezon ko de diya. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke jin logon ko baagh aap ne diya tha unmein Ubaii aur Hassan (Raziallahu anhu) they. unhon-ne bayan kya ke Hassan (Raziallahu anhu) ne apna hissey Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ko bech diya to kisi ne unse kaha ke kya aap abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ka diya hua maal beech rahe ho? Hassan (Raziallahu anhu) ne jawab diya ke main khajoor ka aik saa roopon ke aik saa ke badal kyon na bechoon. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ye baagh bani Hadeela ke mohalle ke qareeb tha jisey Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne (bataur qile' ke) tameer kya tha."
"2759","kuchh log guman karne lagey hain ke ye aayat (jis zikr unwaan mein hua) meeraas ki aayat mansukh ho gaee hai, nahi qism Allah ki aayat mansukh nahi hui albatta log is par amal karne mein sust ho gaey hain. tarkey ke leney waley 2 tarah ke hotey hain aik wo jo waaris hon unko hissey diya jaeyga doosrey wo jo waaris na hon unko narmii se jawab dene ka hukm hai. wo yun kahey miyan main tum ko dene ka ikhtiyar nahi rakhta ."
"2760","aik sahabi (Sa'd bin Ubaada) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke meri walida ki maut achcha waaqe ho gaee, mera khayal hai ke agar unhein guftgu ka mauqa milta to wo sadqa kartin to kya main unki taraf se khairat kar sakta hoon? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya haan unki taraf se khairat kar."
"2761","Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se masla poochha, unhon-ne arz kya ke meri maan ka intiqal ho gaya hai aur uske zimme aik nazar thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unki taraf se nazar poori kar de."
"2762","qabila banii-Saaida ke bhai Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ki maan ka intiqal hua to wo unki khidmat mein hazir nahi they (balke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath jang daumatul-Jandal mein Sharik they) isliye wo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur arz kya ya Rasulullah! meri walida ka intiqal ho gaya hai aur main us waqt maujood nahi tha to agar main unki taraf se khairat karun to unhein iska fayda pahunchega? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan! Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha ke main aapko gawah banata hun ke mera baagh Mikhraaf naam ke unki taraf se khairat hai."
"2763","unhon-ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se aayat (وإن خفتم أن لا تقسطوا في اليتامى فانكحوا ما طاب لكم من النساء) ''aur agar tum daro ke yatimon ke haq mein insaf nahi karogey to (aur) aurton mein se jo tumhen pasand hon unse nikah kar lo.'' ka matlab puchha to Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne farmaya ke us se murad wo yateem ladki hai jo apne wali ki zer parwarish ho, phir wali ke dil mein uska Husn aur uske maal ki taraf se raghbate-nikaah paida ho jaey magar us kam mehar par jo waisii ladkiyon ka hona chahiye to is tarah nikah karne se rokaa gaya lekin ye ke wali unke sath poorey mehar ki adaaeygi mein insaf se kaam lein (to nikah kar saktey hain) aur unhein ladkiyon ke siwa dusri aurton se nikah karne ka hukm diya gaya. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke phir logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha to izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ne ye aayat nazil farmai ( ويستفتونك في Nisa قل الله يفتيكم فيهن‏ ( '' aap se log aurton ke mutaalliq poochhtey hain aap keh dein ke Allah tumhen unke barey mein hidayat karta hai.'' Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke phir Allah Taala ne is aayat mein bayan kar diya ke yateem ladki agar khoobsurat aur maal wali ho aur (unke wali) unse nikah karne ke khaahishmand hon lekin pura mehar dene mein unke ( khandan ke) tariqon ki pabandi na kar sakein to (wo unse nikah mat karein ( jabke maal aur Husn ki kami ki wjah se unki taraf unhein koi raghbat na hoti ho to unhein wo chhod detey aur unke siwa kisi dusri aurat ko talash kartey. rawi ne kaha jis tarah aisey log raghbat na honey ki sura mein un yateem ladkiyon ko chhod detey, isi tarah unke liye ye bhi jaaiz nahi ke jab un ladkiyon ki taraf unhein raghbat ho to unke poorey mehar ke mamley main aur unke huquq ada karne mein insaf se kaam liye baghair unse nikah karein."
"2764","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne apni aik jaaidaad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein waqf kar di, us jaaidaad ka naam samagh tha aur ye aik khajoor ka aik baagh tha. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ya Rasulullah ! mujhey aik jaaidaad mili hai aur mere khayal mein bahut hi umda hai, isliye maine chaha ke usey sadqa kar dun to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke asl maal ko sadqa karke na bechaa ja sakey na hiba kya ja sakey aur na iska koi waaris bin sakey, sirf iska phal (Allah ki raah mein) kharch ho. chunanche umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey sadqa kar diya, unka ye sadqa ghaziyon ke liye, ghulam aazad karaaney ke liye, mohtajon aur kamzoron ke liye, musaafiron ke liye aur rishtedaron ke liye tha aur ye ke iske nigraan ke liye usmein koi muzaayqa nahi hoga ke wo dastoor ke muwafiq usmein se khaaey ya apne kisi dost ko khilaey basharte ke usmein se maal jama karne ka irada na rakhta ho."
"2765","(Qur'aan Majeed ki us aayat) ومن كان غنيا فليستعفف ومن كان فقيرا فليأكل بالمعروف ''aur jo shakhs maaldaar ho wo apne ko yateem ke maal se bilkul rokey rakhey, albatta jo shakhs naadaar ho to wo dastoor ke mutabiq kha sakta hai'' ke barey mein farmaya ke yatimon ke waliyon ke barey mein nazil hui ke yateem ke maal mein se agar wali naadaar ho to dastoor ke mutabiq iske maal mein se ley sakta hai."
"2766","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''saat (7) gunahon se jo tabah kar dene waley hain bachtey raho. ''sahaaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne puchha ya Rasulullah! wo kon se gunah hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah ke sath kisi ko Sharik thahraanaa, jadoo karnaa, kisi ki nahaq jaan lena ke jisey Allah Taala ne haram qarar diya hai, sood khaanaa, yateem ka maal khaanaa, ladai mein se bhag jaana, paak daman bhuli bhaalii eman wali aurton par tohmat lagaanaa.''"
"2767","ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko koi wasii banata to wo kabhi inkar na kartey. Ibne-Sirin Taabai (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ka mahboob mashghala ye tha ke yateem ke maal w jaaidaad ke silsiley mein unke khair-khaahon aur waliyon ko jama kartey taake unke liye koi achi sura paida karne ke liye ghaur karein. Taaus Taabai (Rahmatullahi-alaih) se jab yatimon ke barey mein koi sawal kya jata to aap ye aayat padhtey ke) والله يعلم المفسد من المصلح‏ ( ''aur Allah fasaad paida karne waley aur sanwaarney waley ko khub janta hai.'' ata (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne yatimon ke barey mein kaha chahe wo maamooli qism ke logon mein hon ya badey darjey ke, uska wali uske hisse mein se jaisey uske laaiq ho, waisaa is par kharch kare."
"2768","ham se Yaqoob-bin-Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) bin Kasir ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Ismaaeel-bin-Ulaih ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Abdul-Azeez bin-Suhaib ne bayan kya, unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madiney tashrif laey to unke sath koi khaadim nahi tha. isliye abu-Talha (jo mere sauteley bap they) mera hath pakadkar Rasulullah ki khidmat me ley gaey aur kaha : aey Allah ke rasool Anas ek samajhdaar bachchaa hai, ye aapki khidmat kiya karega. Hazrat Anas kahtey hain ki maine aapkey sath safar or qiyam donon me khidmatki, aapney mujhsey kabhi kisi kaam ke barey me jisey maine kar diya ho, ye nahi farmaya ki ye kaam tumney is tarah kyon kiya? isi tarah kisi aise kaam ke barey me jisey main na kar saka hun aapney ye nahi Farmaya ki tooney ye kaam is tarah kyaon nahi kiya?"
"2769","abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) khajoor ke baghaat ke eitibaar se Madina ke Ansar mein sabse badey maaldaar they aur unhein apne tamam maalon mein masjide-Nabawi ke samney beerhaa ka baagh sabse zyada pasand tha. khud Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi us baagh mein tashrif ley jatey aur iska meethaa pani peetey they. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir jab ye aayat nazil huii ( لن تنالوا البر حتى تنفقوا مما تحبون‏ ) ''nekii tum hargiz nahi hasil karogey jab tak apne us maal se na kharch karo jo tumhen pasand hon.'' to abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) uthey aur aa kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! Allah Taala farmata hai ( لن تنالوا البر حتى تنفقوا مما تحبون‏ ) ''tum neki hargiz nahi hasil kar sakogey jab tak apne un maalon mein se na kharch karo jo tumhen zyada pasand hon.'' aur mere maalon mein mujhey sabse zyada pasand beerhaa hai aur ye Allah ke raaste mein sadqa hai, main Allah ki bargah se uski neki aur zakheera aakhirat honey ki ummeed rakhta hun. aapko jahan Allah Taala bataaey usey kharch karein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya shaabaash ye to bada fayda bakhsh maal hai ya aap ne bajaey ( رابح ( رابع ke) رايح ( kaha ye shak Abdullaah-bin-Muslima rawi ko hua tha. aur jo kuchh tum ne kaha maine sab sun liya hai aur mera khayal hai ke tum usey apne naatey walon ko de do. abu-Talha ne arz kya ya Rasulullah! main aisa hi karunga. chunanche unhon-ne apne azeezon aur apne chacha ke ladkon mein taqseem kar diya. Ismaaeel, Abdullah-bin Yusuf aur Yahya-bin-Yahya ne Malik ke waastey se. ( رابح (ke bajaey ( رايح ( bayan kya hai."
"2770","aik sahabi Sad-bin-Ubada ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ke unki maan ka intiqal ho gaya hai. kya agar wo unki taraf se khairat karein to unhein iska fayda pahunchega? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jawab diya ke haan. is par un sahabi ne kaha ke mera mewon se bharaa aik baagh hai aur main aapko gawah banata hun ke maine wo unki taraf se sadqa kar diya."
"2771","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (Madina mein) masjid banaaney ka hukm diya aur bani najaar se farmaya tum apne us baagh ka mujh se mol kar lo. unhon-ne kaha ke hargiz nahi Allah ki qism ham to Allah hi se iska mol lengey."
"2772","ham se musaddad-bin-Musarhid ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Yazeed bin Zaree ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Abdullaah-bin-A'un (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya unse Naafe ne aur unse Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke umr ko Khaibar me ek zameen mili to aap Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat me hazir hue aur kaha ki mujhey ek zameen mili hai or issey behtar maal mujhey kabhi nahi mila tha, aap iskey barey me mujhe kya mashwaraa dete hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Farmaya ki agar chahey to asal jaayedaad apne qabzey me rakh ley aur uskey nafey aur faaydey ko khairat kar dey."" chunaanchey umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey us shart par sadqaa (waqf) kar diya ki asal zameen n bechii jaey"
"2773","ham se abu-Aasim ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha ham se Abdullaah-bin-A'un ne bayan kya, unse Naafe ne bayan kya, unse Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko Khaibar me ek jaaydaad mili to aap Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat me hazir hokar uskey barey me khabar di. pyaarey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar chaho to usey sadqaa kar do. chunaanchey Hazrat umr ne usey faqeeron, miskeenon, rishtedaron or mehmaanon ke liye usey sadqaa kar diya."
"2774","ham se Ishaq-bin-Mansur ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Abdus-Samad ne bayan kya, kaha ke maine apne walid (abdul-Waaris) se suna, unse Abu-Tayyah ne bayan kya, kaha ke mujh se Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke jab pyaarey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina tashrif laey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masjid banaaney ke liye hukm diya aur farmaya : aey banu-Najjaar! apney baagh ki mujhsey qeemat le lo."" unhoney kaha ki nahi"
"2775","mujh se Naafe ne bayan kya, aur unse Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne apna aik ghoda Allah ke rastey mein (jihad karne ke liye) aik aadmi ko de diya. ye ghoda Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne diya tha, taake Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jihad mein kisi ko is par Sawar karein. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko malum hua ke jis shakhs ko ye ghoda mila tha, wo us ghodey ko bazar mein bech raha hai. isliye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ke kya wo usey khareed saktey hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hargiz usey na khareed. apna diya hua sadqa wapas na ley."
"2776","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo aadmi mere waaris hain, jo rupya ashrafii agar main chhod jaun to wo taqseem na karein, wo meri beeviyon ka kharch aur jaaidaad ka ehtimaam karne waley ka kharch nikalney ke baad sadqa hai.''"
"2777","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne waqf mein ye shart lagai thi ke iska mutwallii usmein se kha sakta hai aur apne dost ko khilaa sakta hai lekin wo daulat na jodey."
"2778","Abdaan ne bayan kya ke mujhey mere walid ne khabar di, unhein Shoba ne, unhein Abu-Ishaq ne, unhein abu-Abdur-Rehman ne ke jab Hazrat Usman ghanii (Raziallahu anhu) ka gheraaw kar liya gaya to (apney ghar key) uper chadhkar aapney baaghiyon se kaha ki main tumko khuda ki qasam dekar poochhta hun aur sirf Nabi Karim ke sahaabiyon se qism dekar poochhta hun ki kya aap logon ko malum nahi hai ki jab Allah ke rasool ne farmaya jo shakhs Roomaa kuney ko khodeygaa aur usey musalmaanon ke liye waqf kar dega to usey jannat ki khushkhabri hai."" to maine hi us kuney ko khodaa tha. kya aap logon ko malum nahii hai ki pyaare Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab Farmaya tha ki ""ghazwaaey-Tabook par jaanewaaley (Jaishe-Usrat) ko jo shakhs saazo-saamaan se lais kar dega to usey jannat ki khushkhabri hai"" to maine hi usey lais kiya tha. rawi ne bayan kiya ki aapkii in baton ki sabney tasdeeq ki thi. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne waqf ke barey me farmaya tha ki iska intizam karnewaalaa agar ismein so khaaey to koi haraj nahi hai. zahir hai ki muntazim khud wo bhi ho sakta hai jisey waqf kiya gaya hai or kabhi doosrey bhi ho saktey hain or har ek ke liye ye jaayez hai."""
"2779","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ''aey banu-Najjaar! tum apne baagh ki qeemat mujh se wsool kar lo to unhon-ne arz kya ke ham uski qeemat Allah Taala ke siwa kisi se nahi chaahtey.''"
"2780","banii-Saham ka aik shakhs Tameem daari aur Adii-bin-Badaa ke sath safar ko nikla, wo aisey mulk mein ja kar mar gaya jahan koi musalman na tha. ye donon shakhs uska chhoda hua maal lekar Madina wapas aaey. uske saman mein chandi ka aik glaas gum tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un donon ko qism khaney ka hukm farmaya (unhon-ne qism kha lii) phir aisa hua ke wo glaas Makka mein mila, unhon-ne kaha ham ne ye glaas Tameem aur Adi se khareedaa hai. us waqt maiyat ke 2 azeez (Amr-bin-al-Aas aur muttalib khadey huey aur unhon-ne qism khaaii ke ye hamari gawahi Tameem aur Adi ki gawahi se zyada moa'tabar hai, ye glaas maiyat hi ka hai. Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha un hi ke barey mein ye aayat nazil hui (ya أيها الذين آمنوا شهادة بينكم‏ ( aakhir aayat tak."
"2781","unke walid (Abdullaah (Raziallahu anhu)) Uhud ki ladai mein Shahid ho gaey they. apne peechhey chh ladkiyan chhodi thin aur qarz bhii. jab khajoor ke phal todney ka waqt aaya to main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kya ya Rasulullah! aapko ye malum hi hai ke mere walid maajid Uhud ki ladai mein Shahid ho chukey hain aur bahut zyada qarz chhod gaey hain, main chahta tha ke qarz-khaah aapko dekh lein (taake qarz mein kuchh riaayat kar dein) lekin wo Yahudi they aur wo nahi maaney, isliye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jao aur khaliyiaan mein har qism ki khajoor alag-alag kar lo jab maine aisa kar liya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bulaayaa, qarz-khaahon ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh kar aur zyada sakhti shuru kar di thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab ye tarze-amal dekha to sabse badey khajoor ke dher ke gird Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teen chakkar lagaey aur wahin baith gaey phir farmaya ke apne qarz-khaahon ko bulaao. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne naap-naap kar dena shuru kya aur Allah ki qism mere walid ki tamam amanat ada kar di, Allah gawah hai ke main itney par bhi razi tha ke Allah Taala mere walid ka tamam qarz ada kar de aur main apni bahnon ke liye aik khajoor bhi usmein se na ley jaun lekin hua ye ke dher ke dher bach rahe aur maine dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jis dher par baithey huey they usmein se to aik khajoor bhi nahi di gaee thi. abu-Adbullah imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke) أغروا بي ( (hadees mein alfaaz) ke mana hain ke mujh par bhadakney aur sakhti karne lagey. usi mana mein Quran Majeed ki aayat ( فأغرينا بينهم العداوة والبغضاء ( main ( فأغرينا ( hai."